  "body": "Alcatel Linkzone 2 (MW43TM):\n\nhttps://us.alcatelmobile.com/alcatel-linkzone-2/\n\nhttps://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_nkw=alcatel+mw+43+tm+linkzone+2+wifi+4+g+lte+hotspot&norover=1&mkevt=1&mkrid=711-153677-323661-0&mkcid=2&mkscid=102&keyword=Electronics,SRP&crlp=_&MT_ID=&geo_id=&rlsatarget=dat-2328490750103156:loc-66&adpos=&device=c&mktype=&loc=186981&poi=&abcId=&cmpgn=603518122&sitelnk=&adgroupid=1227055987794418&network=s&matchtype=b\n\nCheaper with a better battery and based on the same Qualcomm chipset.\n\nEdit:\nUnlockable as well.",
